== Recent News

- \[December 2022\] Our [https://ut-austin-rpl.github.io/sailor/ work] on using prior datasets to accelerate imitation learning for new tasks will be presented at [https://corl2022.org/ CoRL 2022].

- \[December 2022\] Our work on [https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.11287 model-based counterfactual data augmentation] will be presented at [https://neurips.cc/ NeurIPS 2022].

- \[December 2022\] We released a new framework called [https://minedojo.org/ MineDojo] for building generalist agents that can solve open-ended tasks with internet scale knowledge in MineCraft. MineDojo will be presented at [https://neurips.cc/ NeurIPS 2022].

== About Me

I am a research scientist at NVIDIA AI working with [https://research.nvidia.com/person/dieter-fox Dieter Fox] in the [https://nvidia_srl.gitlab.io/ Seattle Robotics Lab]. I obtained my PhD degree from Stanford University, co-advised by [http://cvgl.stanford.edu/silvio/ Silvio Savarese] and [http://vision.stanford.edu/feifeili/ Fei-Fei Li]. My research focuses on developing systems and algorithms to enable robots to learn useful manipulation tasks.

